    "Each app and app extension installed with AltForge must register an App ID with Apple.\n\nApp IDs for paid developer accounts never expire, and there is no limit to how many you can create." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AltForgeでインストールされた各アプリおよびアプリ拡張機能は、AppleにアプリIDを登録する必要があります。\n\n有料の開発者用アカウントのアプリIDには期限がなく、作成数に制限はありません。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada app e extensão de app instalada com o AltForge deve registrar um App ID com a Apple.\n\nEm contas de desenvolvedor pagas, os App IDs nunca expiram e não há limite de criação."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 AltForge 安装的每个 App 和 App 扩展都必须向 Apple 注册一个 App ID。\n\n付费开发者账户的 App ID 永不过期，创建数量也不受限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app and app extension installed with AltForge must register an App ID with Apple. Apple limits non-developer Apple IDs to 10 App IDs at a time.\n\n**App IDs can't be deleted**, but they do expire after one week. AltForge will automatically renew App IDs for all active apps once they've expired." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AltForgeでインストールされた各アプリおよびアプリ拡張機能は、AppleにアプリIDを登録する必要があります。非開発者用の Apple ID では、同時に作成できるApp IDは最大10件までです。\n\n\n**アプリIDは削除できません**が、1週間後に期限切れとなります。AltForgeは、期限が切れたすべてのアクティブなアプリのアプリIDを自動的に更新します。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada app e extensão de app instalada com o AltForge deve registrar um App ID com a Apple. A Apple limita Apple IDs de não desenvolvedor a 10 App IDs por vez.\n\n**Os App IDs não podem ser excluídos**, mas expiram após uma semana. O AltForge os renovará automaticamente para todos os apps ativos quando expirarem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 AltForge 安装的每个 App 和 App 扩展都必须向 Apple 注册一个 App ID。非开发者 Apple ID 同时最多可注册 10 个 App ID。\n\n**App ID 无法删除**，但会在一周后过期。App ID 过期后，AltForge 会自动为所有已激活 App 续期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Background Refresh to automatically refresh apps in the background when connected to the same Wi-Fi as AltForge Server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AltForge Serverと同じWi-Fiに接続しているときに、バックグラウンドでアプリを自動的に更新するには、バックグラウンド更新を有効にしてください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ative a atualização em segundo plano para atualizar automaticamente os apps em segundo plano quando estiver conectado à mesma rede Wi-Fi que o AltForge Server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后台刷新，以便在连接到与 AltForge Server 相同的 Wi-Fi 时自动在后台刷新 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable JIT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
