    "This jailbreak has an untethered version, which means %@ will never expire — even after 7 days or rebooting the device.\n\nInstalling an untethered jailbreak requires a few extra steps, but AltForge will walk you through the process.\n\nWould you like to continue? " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この脱獄にはアンテザードバージョンがあります。つまり%@は、7日経過後やデバイスの再起動後でも有効期限が切れることはありません。\n\nアンテザード脱獄のインストールには追加手順が必要ですが、AltForgeがプロセスをご案内します。\n\n続行してもよろしいですか？"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este jailbreak possui uma versão untethered, o que significa que %@ nunca expirará — mesmo após 7 dias ou ao reiniciar o dispositivo.\n\nA instalação de um jailbreak untethered requer algumas etapas extras, mas o AltForge irá guiar você durante o processo.\n\nDeseja continuar?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此越狱工具支持完美越狱，这意味着 %@ 永不过期，即使超过 7 天或设备重启也不受影响。\n\n进行完美越狱需要一些额外步骤，AltForge 会引导你完成整个过程。\n\n要继续吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This jailbreak is untethered, which means %@ will never expire — even after 7 days or rebooting the device.\n\nInstalling an untethered jailbreak requires a few extra steps, but AltForge will walk you through the process.\n\nWould you like to continue? " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この脱獄はアンテザードです。つまり%@は、7日経過後やデバイスの再起動後も期限切れになることはありません。\n\nアンテザード脱獄のインストールには追加手順が必要ですが、AltForgeがプロセスをご案内します。\n\n続行してもよろしいですか？"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este jailbreak é untethered, o que significa que %@ nunca expirará — mesmo após 7 dias ou ao reiniciar o dispositivo.\n\nA instalação de um jailbreak untethered requer algumas etapas extras, mas o AltForge irá guiar você durante o processo.\n\nDeseja continuar?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是完美越狱，因此 %@ 永不过期，即使超过 7 天或设备重启也不受影响。\n\n安装完美越狱需要一些额外步骤，AltForge 会引导你完成整个过程。\n\n要继续吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request requires an authenticated user." : {
