            "value" : "剔除扩展（推荐）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removing extensions is recommended for free Apple IDs. It usually does not affect the app's main features, but widgets, share actions, notifications, or other extension-only features may be unavailable. Keeping them signs every extension and may exceed the active-app or weekly App ID limit, causing installation to fail." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费 Apple ID 建议剔除扩展。通常不会影响 App 的主要功能，但小组件、分享操作、通知或其他仅由扩展提供的功能可能不可用。保留后需要逐个签名，可能超过活跃 App 或每周 App ID 限额并导致安装失败。"
          }
