            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请确保 App 正在设备前台运行，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make sure you have trusted this device with your computer and Wi-Fi sync is enabled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请确保已在电脑上信任此设备，并已启用 Wi-Fi 同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please deactivate a sideloaded app in order to install another one.\n\nIf you're running iOS 13.5 or later, make sure “Offload Unused Apps” is disabled in Settings > iTunes & App Stores, then install or delete all offloaded apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请停用一个已侧载的 App，然后再安装其他 App。\n\n如果你运行的是 iOS 13.5 或更高版本，请确保已在“设置”>“iTunes 与 App Store”中关闭“卸载未使用的 App”，然后安装或删除所有已卸载的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please deactivate a sideloaded app with AltForge in order to install another app.\n\nIf you're running iOS 13.5 or later, make sure 'Offload Unused Apps' is disabled in Settings > iTunes & App Stores, then install or delete all offloaded apps to prevent them from erroneously counting towards this limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请使用 AltForge 停用一个已侧载的 App，然后再安装其他 App。\n\n如果你运行的是 iOS 13.5 或更高版本，请确保已在“设置”>“iTunes 与 App Store”中关闭“卸载未使用的 App”，然后安装或删除所有已卸载的 App，以免它们被错误计入此限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please follow the AltForge AltJIT guide to install all required dependencies, then try again." : {
